# Nothing secret or bulky goes into the image. The API key lives in
# .env.local on a laptop and in the host's environment when deployed —
# baking it into an image that gets pushed to a registry would publish it.
.env.local
.env
.git
.github
.log
__pycache__
*.pyc
tests
packets
drafts
state-*.sqlite3
state.sqlite3
last_results*.json
*.md
!README.md
